  "scenario": "A buyer wants one phone purchased now to remain pleasant and safe to use through 2031. The frozen material contains three old or renewed phone seller snapshots, an exact iPhone X aftermarket battery kit, an exact Galaxy A13 5G protective case, three dated long-use iPhone anecdotes, and generic pages about screen burn-in, planned obsolescence, repairability, modular smartphones, and service life. It contains no current manufacturer support-end promise for a 2026 candidate, no controlled longitudinal comparison of the listed phones, no verified condition report for the renewed units, no population failure rates, and no evidence that one model is a universal 2031 winner.",
